    "Narration & Listening Languages" : {

    },
    "No timer to set. Saathi keeps you company while you walk and wraps up on its own when your Apple Watch or iPhone Outdoor Walk ends, when you've stopped walking for a while (it asks first), or when you tap End. Your episode then includes your walk's distance, time and steps. Saathi reads totals only, never your route." : {

    },
    "no_source_fallback" : {
      "comment" : "I don't have a source for that.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
